## Session Lifecycle

### On Session Start (READ)

1. Read your LLM-specific file for tool/memory config
2. Read this file
3. Read {{DEPTH_FILE}} for current state
4. Check retro tracker — is a retro due?

### On Session End (UPDATE)

1. Update {{DEPTH_FILE}} if state changed
2. Add changelog entry if work was done
3. Save learnings to your LLM's memory system
4. Increment task count in retro tracker

